<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Snapfizz Intelligence</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background: #f4f7fb;
      color: #333;
    }
    header {
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #000428, #004e92);
      color: white;
      padding: 3rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    header h1 {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      margin: 0;
    }
    header p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }
    .section {
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 2rem auto;
      padding: 0 1rem;
    }
    .cta {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #007BFF;
      color: white;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    footer {
      background: #222;
      color: #ccc;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <h1>Snapfizz Intelligence</h1>
    <p>We Turn ESG Reports into Business Growth Engines</p>
    <a class="cta" href="#calculator">Try the ESG Leak Detector</a>
  </header>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>🚀 Why Snapfizz?</h2>
      <p>Snapfizz uncovers marketing & sustainability blind spots hidden in your ESG reports. Think of us as your Growth X Sustainability lab. From Unilever to L’Oréal—we reverse-engineer impact.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card" id="calculator">
      <h2>🔍 Live ESG Leak Detector</h2>
      <p><i>Used by Unilever to reveal a $300M missed opportunity.</i></p>
      <a class="cta" href="https://snapfizzintelligence.github.io/snapfizz-intelligence/esg-calculator.html">Launch Calculator</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>📊 Recent Demo</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><b>Nestlé:</b> ESG Score 48/100 → $300M revenue at risk</li>
        <li><b>Patagonia:</b> Strong metrics, weak gamification</li>
        <li><b>Marriott:</b> No Sunday experience layer = loyalty leak</li>
      </ul>
      <p><i>We analyze. You grow.</i></p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>💬 Trusted By</h2>
      <p>“Snapfizz found gaps even McKinsey missed.”<br><b>— Fortune 500 ESG Director</b></p>
      <p>“25% more engagement with gamified Sundays.”<br><b>— Unilever Regional Head</b></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    © 2025 Snapfizz Intelligence | Built by Tulasi & ChatGPT | <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/tulasipariyar" style="color: #aaa;">Connect on LinkedIn</a>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
